      "start_seconds": 48.76,
      "end_seconds": 68.01,
      "duration_seconds": 19.25,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get marks left after the spots as well. The, The marks left after the spots? That's been for about a year. I've also been feeling low about my skin, for two years"
