      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.0,
      "end_seconds": 287.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "There are red inflamed lumps and blackheads over both cheeks and the forehead, and a few scars."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.39,
      "end_seconds": 305.93,
      "duration_seconds": 13.54,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. From what you've told me and what I found this is probably moderate inflammatory acne. A hormonal cause is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.07,
      "end_seconds": 351.05,
      "duration_seconds": 34.98,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange blood tests for acne treatment baseline let's use adapalene gel, 0.1 percent, once a night, for twelve weeks that should help with acne use sunscreen daily, and the gel can sting for the the first couple of weeks and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose i'll want another look in six weeks i think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
